1
00:00:20,480 --> 00:00:21,310
you stop?

2
00:01:19,780 --> 00:01:21,800
Dreaming on!

3
00:01:32,740 --> 00:01:34,140
Oh, I get it now.

4
00:01:34,500 --> 00:01:39,440
You're gonna turn into your Sulong form
and go berserk once you gaze at the moon.

5
00:01:53,380 --> 00:01:54,260
It's Jack!

6
00:02:00,000 --> 00:02:03,360
You put together a hell
of a plan, didn't you?

7
00:02:03,560 --> 00:02:06,077
But that doesn't mean
you're strong enough to win.

8
00:02:06,160 --> 00:02:07,748
Just that we were careless.

9
00:02:08,820 --> 00:02:11,540
You won't lay another finger on Kaido.

10
00:02:11,940 --> 00:02:15,500
I'm about to die the snow
red with your blood! Yeah!

11
00:02:17,880 --> 00:02:20,080
Hold your swords. One moment.

12
00:02:20,980 --> 00:02:24,997
Jack devastated our thousand-year-old
kingdom and tormented our people.

13
00:02:25,080 --> 00:02:26,880
That man is our sworn enemy.

14
00:02:27,220 --> 00:02:30,749
We turned him away countless
times, but he would not relent.

15
00:02:31,080 --> 00:02:33,957
The warrior you were
searching for is right here!

16
00:02:34,040 --> 00:02:35,080
It is I!

17
00:02:37,320 --> 00:02:38,150
Race...

18
00:02:38,233 --> 00:02:39,760
I owe the Minx my life!

19
00:02:39,980 --> 00:02:44,215
Every cruelty you committed shall be
punished with the force of my fury!

20
00:02:57,660 --> 00:03:01,120
Please allow us to save
your power for Kaido.

21
00:03:01,920 --> 00:03:03,060
You Karoo as well.

22
00:03:18,300 --> 00:03:20,340
All right, then best of luck.

23
00:03:20,500 --> 00:03:21,340
I'm grateful.

24
00:03:21,960 --> 00:03:26,400
I promise you, Karoo, that I will
show Kaido every ounce of my strength.

25
00:03:51,340 --> 00:04:13,030
Uh!

26
00:04:18,040 --> 00:04:18,870
Ah!

27
00:04:36,100 --> 00:04:37,180
Don't worry.

28
00:04:37,460 --> 00:04:39,754
They can't maintain that for over long.

29
00:04:39,960 --> 00:04:41,300
Yeah, bring it on.

30
00:04:41,560 --> 00:04:43,020
We're Beast 2, you know.

31
00:05:07,080 --> 00:05:10,157
they must have started fighting you think

32
00:05:10,240 --> 00:05:13,005
that rat master jack went
outside with them too

33
00:05:13,820 --> 00:05:16,467
Unlike you, he's
considerate enough to leave.

34
00:05:18,220 --> 00:05:20,760
Excuse me. What was that?

35
00:05:21,120 --> 00:05:24,960
If you've got a problem with
me, just say some, punk ass.

36
00:05:26,240 --> 00:05:27,070
Shinobu?

37
00:05:28,920 --> 00:05:29,940
Ripe, ripe.

38
00:05:30,280 --> 00:05:31,280
Enticement jutsu.

39
00:05:39,740 --> 00:05:40,880
Steady now.

40
00:05:52,320 --> 00:05:53,150
No!

41
00:05:56,440 --> 00:05:57,620
No! Oh, no!

42
00:06:01,860 --> 00:06:08,140
Your plan was solid in theory, but the
execution was lacking, to say the least.

43
00:06:12,840 --> 00:06:13,880
Oh!

44
00:06:21,440 --> 00:06:22,800
Shinobu!

45
00:06:27,700 --> 00:06:29,840
Shinobu! Oh no!

46
00:06:33,100 --> 00:06:34,460
Shinobu!

47
00:06:35,400 --> 00:06:37,440
Lord Momonosuke!

48
00:06:40,840 --> 00:06:42,369
I passed out for a moment.

49
00:06:43,440 --> 00:06:44,580
Now, away!

50
00:06:55,360 --> 00:06:56,240
Wait, what?

51
00:06:58,060 --> 00:07:00,360
Oh, how the hell is he flying?

52
00:07:00,660 --> 00:07:02,248
And why is he so bad at it?

53
00:07:08,440 --> 00:07:09,880
I'm too high up!

54
00:07:10,160 --> 00:07:11,000
It's scary!

55
00:07:14,600 --> 00:07:16,640
He's floating through the air.

56
00:07:16,920 --> 00:07:18,740
What sorcery is this?

57
00:07:23,700 --> 00:07:28,020
On behalf of the commander,
I shall execute you.

58
00:07:45,740 --> 00:07:48,000
I can't see a damn thing!

59
00:07:48,380 --> 00:07:49,556
How's he doin' that?

60
00:08:00,240 --> 00:08:01,960
I got it all!

61
00:08:02,300 --> 00:08:03,440
Just in time!

62
00:08:04,440 --> 00:08:05,417
It's Soji!

63
00:08:05,500 --> 00:08:06,500
Let's go!

64
00:08:10,660 --> 00:08:12,240
Hand over the boy.

65
00:08:12,840 --> 00:08:16,958
He and the Kozuki-nei must be erased
from this world once and for all.

66
00:08:34,300 --> 00:08:36,359
Don't worry, I've got you, my lord.

67
00:08:42,200 --> 00:08:45,580
Hey, Momo, nice speech earlier.

68
00:08:46,020 --> 00:08:47,340
You were badass.

69
00:08:50,240 --> 00:08:52,620
Scar, hear me now!

70
00:08:53,020 --> 00:08:57,980
I shall become the Shugen
of the Land of Plano!

71
00:09:02,000 --> 00:09:04,300
I did my best.

72
00:09:06,280 --> 00:09:07,620
All right, Shinobu.

73
00:09:07,820 --> 00:09:10,020
Keep him safe. Understood.

74
00:09:10,980 --> 00:09:14,740
Scar, I shall repay you! Look!

75
00:09:15,040 --> 00:09:16,900
Lord Momonosuke's been saved!

76
00:09:18,380 --> 00:09:20,440
You're not going anywhere.

77
00:09:20,740 --> 00:09:22,040
Acceleration device!

78
00:09:36,360 --> 00:09:37,880
Stealth mode!

79
00:09:53,240 --> 00:09:56,580
Shooting star, shoulder kick!

80
00:10:16,980 --> 00:10:18,380
Ahhhhhhhh!

81
00:10:19,280 --> 00:10:20,110
I'm ready.

82
00:10:20,840 --> 00:10:22,240
Ahhhhhhh!

83
00:10:23,520 --> 00:10:24,350
Ahhhhh!

84
00:10:24,760 --> 00:10:25,590
Ahhhhh!

85
00:10:57,820 --> 00:10:59,040
Whoa, whoa, whoa!

86
00:10:59,240 --> 00:11:00,181
Hold up, my guy!

87
00:11:00,380 --> 00:11:02,260
I can't feel a losing end here.

88
00:11:02,440 --> 00:11:03,300
Knock it off!

89
00:11:06,780 --> 00:11:07,610
Huh?

90
00:11:07,693 --> 00:11:09,029
Damn it, you bird bastard!

91
00:11:11,020 --> 00:11:14,961
You're gonna leave a gigantic hole
in my torso if you keep this up!

92
00:11:15,100 --> 00:11:18,160
And more than just that,
I'll rip you in two.

93
00:11:18,820 --> 00:11:21,820
If you're so scared, why
don't you disappear again?

94
00:11:22,460 --> 00:11:26,797
This might be hard for your bird brain
to comprehend, but it's just a trick!

95
00:11:26,880 --> 00:11:28,020
Let me go, damn it!

96
00:11:28,180 --> 00:11:29,160
Say goodbye. Ah!

97
00:11:34,380 --> 00:11:35,380
Sanji, no!

98
00:11:41,440 --> 00:11:43,160
That attack was crazy.

99
00:11:44,140 --> 00:11:45,787
I think Sanji needs my help.

100
00:11:45,900 --> 00:11:48,080
Hey, Yamato, be back in a sec.

101
00:11:48,340 --> 00:11:50,000
Keep an eye on Momo for me.

102
00:11:50,220 --> 00:11:51,340
Is that okay?

103
00:11:51,660 --> 00:11:53,072
Why wouldn't it be okay?

104
00:11:53,560 --> 00:11:54,420
Uh, right.

105
00:11:54,700 --> 00:11:56,817
You have a point. He...

106
00:11:56,900 --> 00:11:58,660
he is my son after all.

107
00:12:01,240 --> 00:12:02,640
Then hurry it up.

108
00:12:02,800 --> 00:12:04,035
Yeah, leave it to me.

109
00:12:04,320 --> 00:12:07,877
That boy will be protected because
that's what good parents do.

110
00:12:07,960 --> 00:12:09,680
Hey, I'm not done with you.

111
00:12:09,780 --> 00:12:11,260
Wait for me, Momonosuke.

112
00:12:11,520 --> 00:12:12,677
Your father is on his way.

113
00:12:12,760 --> 00:12:14,597
Wait, stop running away from me.

114
00:12:14,680 --> 00:12:16,500
Not so fast, you.

115
00:12:20,840 --> 00:12:23,320
Mama, come on out and help Mama.

116
00:12:23,980 --> 00:12:27,957
The sooner we get rid of these samurai,
the sooner the feast can begin.

117
00:12:28,040 --> 00:12:30,600
You guys want that, don't you?

118
00:12:35,200 --> 00:12:37,000
It's time to pay.

119
00:12:37,380 --> 00:12:41,460
Remember the wedding, the tea
party, and now this banquet?

120
00:12:41,840 --> 00:12:45,380
You've managed to destroy
everything I've looked forward to.

121
00:12:46,320 --> 00:12:51,120
I am going to destroy you
in a spectacular fashion.

122
00:12:51,920 --> 00:12:53,560
You will die.

123
00:12:54,480 --> 00:12:56,760
Like the worm you are!

124
00:12:59,080 --> 00:13:00,380
Eat cocoa!

125
00:13:01,380 --> 00:13:02,210
No!

126
00:13:21,600 --> 00:13:23,800
What the hell was that?

127
00:13:33,260 --> 00:13:35,880
That crone is too
powerful for her own good.

128
00:13:36,100 --> 00:13:39,277
From the stories I've heard, she's
not someone we should take lightly.

129
00:13:39,360 --> 00:13:42,536
She's a pirate captain every
bit as fearsome as Kaido.

130
00:13:43,560 --> 00:13:44,390
Seriously?

131
00:13:44,473 --> 00:13:47,717
But if we can't handle one guy, how are
we supposed to handle two of them, huh?

132
00:13:47,800 --> 00:13:51,280
Come on, I need to ditch her
so I can help Momo and Sanji.

133
00:13:51,500 --> 00:13:53,177
If I go to them, she'll follow.

134
00:13:53,260 --> 00:13:56,597
And the last thing I want to
do is put them in more danger!

135
00:13:56,680 --> 00:13:59,460
Oh, Nish, you're rather
slippery, aren't you?

136
00:13:59,800 --> 00:14:02,035
You're scurrying right out of the way!

137
00:14:02,540 --> 00:14:03,380
Oh, Zeus!

138
00:14:09,260 --> 00:14:10,140
Hey, Zeus!

139
00:14:10,500 --> 00:14:11,720
Where are you?

140
00:14:12,980 --> 00:14:14,800
Get back here! Time to go!

141
00:14:15,040 --> 00:14:16,637
Oh, please tell me, what are you doing?

142
00:14:16,720 --> 00:14:18,797
Do you see firsthand how bad Mama can get?

143
00:14:18,880 --> 00:14:20,174
She's gonna murder us!

144
00:14:20,360 --> 00:14:22,060
I'll have to punish you.

145
00:14:23,820 --> 00:14:26,760
Now, let's get this thing over with.

146
00:14:27,940 --> 00:14:29,140
Yes, Mama.

147
00:14:30,060 --> 00:14:30,890
Hey!

148
00:14:31,160 --> 00:14:32,997
Do you want to escape with your life?

149
00:14:33,080 --> 00:14:34,680
Or have Big Mom kill you?

150
00:14:35,680 --> 00:14:37,760
No, but I can't go against Big Mom.

151
00:14:38,220 --> 00:14:40,440
That is enough!

152
00:14:49,940 --> 00:14:52,920
Give him back, you little cat burglar!

153
00:14:57,340 --> 00:14:59,857
Please find it in your
heart to forgive me.

154
00:14:59,940 --> 00:15:01,240
It's all my fault.

155
00:15:01,660 --> 00:15:03,880
I really messed up, Mama.

156
00:15:04,100 --> 00:15:06,160
I should have never disobeyed you.

157
00:15:07,320 --> 00:15:09,200
Honey, it's all right.

158
00:15:09,500 --> 00:15:10,840
Come back home.

159
00:15:11,760 --> 00:15:15,400
You can make it up to me by
taking out this little tramp.

160
00:15:15,820 --> 00:15:18,173
It's the only way you can earn my trust.

161
00:15:19,440 --> 00:15:21,977
I will do anything for you, just say it.

162
00:15:22,060 --> 00:15:25,060
You want me to cut ties
with the earth's a Noodle?

163
00:15:25,380 --> 00:15:27,460
That's what I like to hear.

164
00:15:27,820 --> 00:15:30,520
Now go and make your mama proud.

165
00:15:31,460 --> 00:15:33,980
Dun-dun-dun-dun!

166
00:15:34,440 --> 00:15:37,680
The time it's blown away!

167
00:15:38,680 --> 00:15:40,560
I'm like the wind!

168
00:15:40,920 --> 00:15:41,880
Dun-dun!

169
00:15:43,880 --> 00:15:46,840
You've only got one
chance to make this right.

170
00:15:47,160 --> 00:15:49,600
If you screw this up, you're done for!

171
00:15:52,460 --> 00:15:54,760
Soul sensor, activate.

172
00:15:58,800 --> 00:16:01,360
I am really sorry, Nami.

173
00:16:01,840 --> 00:16:04,140
I must know to you at home.

174
00:16:04,460 --> 00:16:06,400
You pathetic little coward!

175
00:16:06,900 --> 00:16:08,800
I am so over you!

176
00:16:09,320 --> 00:16:11,880
My, my, my, my, my!

177
00:16:12,200 --> 00:16:13,720
Nobody help me!

178
00:16:14,820 --> 00:16:18,037
My brother, I'm by his side.

179
00:16:18,120 --> 00:16:20,177
Like a bird we will fly.

180
00:16:20,260 --> 00:16:22,520
Saying goodbye.

181
00:16:23,260 --> 00:16:25,717
Soaring so high.

182
00:16:25,800 --> 00:16:28,080
You'll hear our cry.

183
00:16:29,260 --> 00:16:31,300
I'm a tough guy.

184
00:16:33,260 --> 00:16:34,817
Born to be free.

185
00:16:34,900 --> 00:16:36,897
Go go break.

186
00:16:36,980 --> 00:16:37,900
Keep.

187
00:16:50,260 --> 00:16:51,090
Oh!

188
00:16:53,020 --> 00:16:55,320
Ray, Ray, go away.

189
00:17:06,780 --> 00:17:07,610
Whoops!

190
00:17:07,693 --> 00:17:09,640
I think I hit something back there.

191
00:17:13,200 --> 00:17:14,440
No biggie.

192
00:17:15,400 --> 00:17:17,880
As long as it wasn't a pretty flower.

193
00:17:21,280 --> 00:17:22,700
Thanks, Big Bro!

194
00:17:26,740 --> 00:17:29,120
Mama, wake up!

195
00:17:29,260 --> 00:17:30,480
They're doomed!

196
00:17:31,100 --> 00:17:33,960
This is about to get
out of Queen real fast!

197
00:17:36,420 --> 00:17:38,520
He hit her straight in the face!

198
00:17:38,700 --> 00:17:39,980
She's gonna flip out!

199
00:17:44,360 --> 00:17:45,500
Big Bro!

200
00:17:49,140 --> 00:17:50,200
Thank you.

201
00:17:50,360 --> 00:17:51,340
You're the best.

202
00:17:51,600 --> 00:17:52,894
Hey, are you Tia okay?

203
00:17:53,220 --> 00:17:54,460
That was crazy.

204
00:17:54,980 --> 00:17:56,580
Yeah, it was crazy awesome.

205
00:17:57,180 --> 00:17:58,010
Frankie's here.

206
00:17:58,093 --> 00:17:59,609
We got this under control.

207
00:18:00,980 --> 00:18:01,810
Forward!

208
00:18:02,060 --> 00:18:03,354
Show him what you got.

209
00:18:09,200 --> 00:18:11,060
Guess we missed the kickoff.

210
00:18:11,860 --> 00:18:13,000
Oh, boy.

211
00:18:13,540 --> 00:18:18,420
That was quite the entrance they made,
but I have a plan. Can you help out?

212
00:18:18,800 --> 00:18:19,630
Of course.

213
00:18:19,760 --> 00:18:20,878
This should be fun.

214
00:18:22,660 --> 00:18:23,740
Wow, nice!

215
00:18:23,980 --> 00:18:26,577
Looks like they've got
things covered for now.

216
00:18:26,660 --> 00:18:28,400
All right, up I go.

217
00:18:28,900 --> 00:18:30,540
Time to help Keenum on.

218
00:18:31,200 --> 00:18:32,180
I'm ready!

219
00:18:37,120 --> 00:18:38,320
There you are!

220
00:18:40,140 --> 00:18:42,180
I'm so glad I found you!

221
00:18:42,660 --> 00:18:44,200
Kozuki Momonosuke!

222
00:18:46,680 --> 00:18:48,040
And who are you?

223
00:18:55,420 --> 00:18:56,880
Hey, Shinobu!

224
00:18:58,320 --> 00:19:00,220
Don't worry, he's our friend!

225
00:19:00,560 --> 00:19:02,460
He's gonna help you guys out!

226
00:19:02,900 --> 00:19:04,020
An ally?

227
00:19:07,480 --> 00:19:10,304
It's safer to be with him
than be by yourselves.

228
00:19:13,000 --> 00:19:13,840
See ya!

229
00:19:17,800 --> 00:19:19,506
You're a friend of Sir Luffy?

230
00:19:19,800 --> 00:19:20,640
I am.

231
00:19:24,580 --> 00:19:25,840
Well, good.

232
00:19:26,140 --> 00:19:27,316
Then I'll trust you.

233
00:19:27,720 --> 00:19:28,960
What is your name?

234
00:19:38,360 --> 00:19:41,880
My name is Kozuki Oden!

235
00:19:44,120 --> 00:19:46,620
And I shall protect you!

236
00:19:49,480 --> 00:19:51,100
You're my father?

237
00:19:51,940 --> 00:19:53,840
Lord Oden!

238
00:19:54,100 --> 00:19:58,940
And I shall protect you! You're my father?

239
00:20:00,680 --> 00:20:06,640
Hold on, you have breasts and horns,

240
00:20:06,980 --> 00:20:09,260
why you're not my father at all!

241
00:20:09,520 --> 00:20:13,720
This is highly suspicious,
you must be our foe! What?

242
00:20:16,440 --> 00:20:18,300
Smoke escape jutsu!

243
00:20:18,460 --> 00:20:21,680
Wait, why are you running away?

244
00:20:34,560 --> 00:20:35,937
There's too many of them.

245
00:20:36,020 --> 00:20:37,957
We just keep getting bogged down.

246
00:20:38,040 --> 00:20:39,137
Yes, you're right.

247
00:20:39,220 --> 00:20:41,657
There's no point in
fighting these small fries.

248
00:20:41,740 --> 00:20:43,157
We need a change of plans.

249
00:20:43,240 --> 00:20:45,160
What about the Toby Ropal?

250
00:20:45,300 --> 00:20:47,497
Those dinosaur people
that Denjiro mentioned.

251
00:20:47,580 --> 00:20:50,497
Might turn the tide if we
could kill some of them.

252
00:20:50,580 --> 00:20:52,840
Maybe that's a bit optimistic.

253
00:20:53,960 --> 00:20:55,517
But even if we can't win.

254
00:20:55,600 --> 00:20:57,012
We can still stall them.

255
00:20:58,920 --> 00:21:00,677
Oh, you brutes.

256
00:21:00,760 --> 00:21:03,380
It takes some nerve to run me over.

257
00:21:04,120 --> 00:21:07,117
Big Mom is about to go berserk. Look

258
00:21:07,200 --> 00:21:14,200
at

259
00:21:22,620 --> 00:21:23,450
all the

260
00:21:23,533 --> 00:21:25,300
Straw Hats lining up.

261
00:21:26,780 --> 00:21:29,220
Are you ready to get crushed?

262
00:21:32,980 --> 00:21:34,520
Hello, Soul King.

263
00:21:35,000 --> 00:21:36,580
It's been quite a while.

264
00:21:37,080 --> 00:21:42,680
If nothing else, I applaud your captain
for gathering so many unique creatures.

265
00:21:42,980 --> 00:21:43,810
Yo-ho-ho!

266
00:21:44,040 --> 00:21:45,805
I see you're a woman of taste.

267
00:21:46,680 --> 00:21:47,510
Yeah?

268
00:21:47,593 --> 00:21:48,940
You like my iron body, old hag?

269
00:21:49,440 --> 00:21:50,640
All right.

270
00:21:51,360 --> 00:21:53,940
Then I'll give you a demonstration!

271
00:21:57,940 --> 00:21:59,220
Cyborg power!

272
00:22:00,400 --> 00:22:01,620
Can't you dig it?

273
00:22:05,680 --> 00:22:07,880
I'm one of a kind, baby!

274
00:22:08,600 --> 00:22:09,560
Franky, stop!

275
00:22:09,800 --> 00:22:10,720
Are you crazy?

276
00:22:10,980 --> 00:22:11,980
She's an emperor!

277
00:22:12,200 --> 00:22:13,060
We gotta run!

278
00:22:14,060 --> 00:22:15,400
Is that so?

279
00:22:16,800 --> 00:22:18,460
Do we run from emperors?

280
00:22:20,620 --> 00:22:21,840
I don't know.

281
00:22:22,800 --> 00:22:23,682
Guess we could.

282
00:22:24,580 --> 00:22:26,320
But what about our captain?

283
00:22:29,160 --> 00:22:31,760
You want him to become
king of the pirates?

284
00:22:32,100 --> 00:22:33,260
Don't you, Nami?

285
00:22:53,840 --> 00:22:55,660
Yikes, they're huge!

286
00:22:56,180 --> 00:22:57,768
What in the world are they?

287
00:23:03,300 --> 00:23:04,840
Hey! Buzz up!

288
00:23:05,180 --> 00:23:07,737
If you're gonna go wild, stay
in your own banquet hall!

289
00:23:07,820 --> 00:23:09,160
Stupid numbers!

290
00:23:16,700 --> 00:23:17,530
No!

291
00:23:17,613 --> 00:23:19,280
They're as big as the horse!

292
00:23:19,680 --> 00:23:20,860
They're monsters!

293
00:23:22,240 --> 00:23:23,070
Ew!

294
00:23:23,153 --> 00:23:25,440
I'm getting mad flashbacks
from Thriller Park.

295
00:23:26,460 --> 00:23:28,877
Ma-ma-ma-ma.

296
00:23:28,960 --> 00:23:30,120
Fancy that.

297
00:23:30,520 --> 00:23:34,740
Those must be Caesar's failed
attempts at recreating ancient giants.

298
00:23:35,040 --> 00:23:38,216
No use to me, but it would
seem that Kaido loses them.

299
00:23:39,260 --> 00:23:40,740
How lovely.

300
00:23:43,220 --> 00:23:45,840
Is he grabbing what I think he's grabbing?

301
00:23:46,100 --> 00:23:47,580
The Brachio tank!

302
00:23:48,020 --> 00:23:49,902
Who's stopping Chopper in there?

303
00:23:50,260 --> 00:23:52,957
Hey, Monster Face, put that down!

304
00:23:53,040 --> 00:23:55,480
or I'm gonna make you.

305
00:23:58,860 --> 00:24:00,260
Franky.

306
00:24:02,820 --> 00:24:04,220
Radical.

307
00:24:06,260 --> 00:24:07,880
Me. I'm free!

308
00:24:12,660 --> 00:24:13,490
Sucker!

309
00:24:24,660 --> 00:24:28,900
Now that my lasers are
upgraded, I'm unstoppable.

310
00:24:29,780 --> 00:24:32,840
You should have saved that attack for me.

311
00:24:34,860 --> 00:24:37,980
It's too late now, Iron Man.

312
00:24:41,840 --> 00:24:43,020
Your hand, madam.

313
00:24:43,780 --> 00:24:46,200
Fish Man Jiu-Jitsu!

314
00:24:46,800 --> 00:24:47,840
Mill floor!

315
00:24:54,020 --> 00:24:55,140
Whirlpool!

316
00:24:55,960 --> 00:24:57,440
Shoulder throw!

317
00:25:03,700 --> 00:25:05,220
And Ophidium!

318
00:25:08,060 --> 00:25:10,180
So huge, isn't they?

319
00:25:10,420 --> 00:25:13,185
I haven't forgotten what
you think of my fleet.

320
00:25:13,420 --> 00:25:16,380
I'll kill you, too, so it is obvious!

321
00:25:20,420 --> 00:25:21,250
Ha!

322
00:25:21,520 --> 00:25:22,400
Good luck!

323
00:25:29,020 --> 00:25:30,320
Nice plan.

324
00:25:33,380 --> 00:25:34,210
Ha!

325
00:25:34,293 --> 00:25:35,189
Went better than expected.

326
00:25:35,560 --> 00:25:38,160
She'll be even angrier when she gets back.

327
00:25:39,940 --> 00:25:42,640
You are quite a remarkable woman.

328
00:25:43,960 --> 00:25:44,790
Good job!

329
00:25:44,873 --> 00:25:46,340
Thanks for the assist.

330
00:25:46,600 --> 00:25:48,365
I could have been scrap metal.

331
00:25:49,260 --> 00:25:51,460
Then I'm glad we made it in time.

332
00:25:52,980 --> 00:25:54,340
And now...

333
00:25:58,420 --> 00:26:01,177
the moment you've all been waiting for.

334
00:26:11,060 --> 00:26:12,097
Commander Chopper!

335
00:26:12,180 --> 00:26:13,840
Got a status report for me?

336
00:26:16,200 --> 00:26:18,297
Oh, stop! Wake up! Oh, stop!

337
00:26:18,380 --> 00:26:19,321
Put it together!

338
00:26:19,480 --> 00:26:21,217
We're getting a call from Franky!

339
00:26:21,300 --> 00:26:24,460
Come on! Hey! What
gives? You good in there?

340
00:26:26,360 --> 00:26:29,760
Yep, couldn't feel better
thanks to the Racco tank.

341
00:26:32,140 --> 00:26:34,200
You remember our promise, right?

342
00:26:36,180 --> 00:26:37,100
Our promise?

343
00:26:38,340 --> 00:26:39,634
We were gonna combine!

344
00:26:40,200 --> 00:26:41,920
The Iron Pirate, bro!

345
00:26:43,140 --> 00:26:44,740
Docking time, baby!

346
00:26:45,360 --> 00:26:46,190
I...

347
00:26:46,920 --> 00:26:47,980
Pirate?

348
00:26:54,220 --> 00:26:55,500
Finally! Woo-hoo!

349
00:26:59,920 --> 00:27:01,680
Good, I can see the sky.

350
00:27:02,260 --> 00:27:04,800
Okay, I think I can make it up from here.

351
00:27:06,940 --> 00:27:08,160
Not so fast!

352
00:27:08,660 --> 00:27:10,920
Oh, Master Queen! Go away!

353
00:27:11,320 --> 00:27:12,438
I'm taking a break.

354
00:27:12,720 --> 00:27:14,020
But it's Straw Hat!

355
00:27:14,880 --> 00:27:15,710
Uh-oh.

356
00:27:15,793 --> 00:27:16,920
What?! He's here?!

357
00:27:19,060 --> 00:27:20,920
And who the hell is that?!

358
00:27:21,500 --> 00:27:22,740
Hey there, Zoro!

359
00:27:23,120 --> 00:27:24,680
Well, look who it is!

360
00:27:24,920 --> 00:27:26,155
Where are you headed?

361
00:27:26,400 --> 00:27:28,000
Up to Psycheidus!

362
00:27:28,440 --> 00:27:29,980
I'm coming with you.

363
00:27:30,340 --> 00:27:32,120
You're not getting away!

364
00:27:40,620 --> 00:27:43,340
What the hell is that thing? It's huge!

365
00:27:44,960 --> 00:27:45,790
Ready?

366
00:27:48,700 --> 00:27:51,820
Kum Kum Rocket!

367
00:27:55,080 --> 00:27:56,660
Good! We got this!

368
00:27:56,840 --> 00:27:58,369
You said Kaino's up there?

369
00:27:58,500 --> 00:28:01,957
Yeah, I think he's started fighting
with Kinemon's group already!

370
00:28:02,040 --> 00:28:03,500
Just a little more!

371
00:28:12,280 --> 00:28:13,110
Damn!

372
00:28:13,800 --> 00:28:16,680
You ain't gone nowhere on my way!

373
00:28:19,780 --> 00:28:20,660
Give up.

374
00:28:20,940 --> 00:28:22,500
I control these skies.

375
00:28:26,340 --> 00:28:28,957
We're never going to make it
with these bastards hounding us.

376
00:28:29,040 --> 00:28:31,452
I just think they'd be guarding the roof!

377
00:28:54,920 --> 00:28:57,038
Yeah, that's what I'm talking about!

378
00:28:57,200 --> 00:28:58,580
Let's do it!

379
00:29:00,780 --> 00:29:01,960
Ducking formation!

380
00:29:02,440 --> 00:29:03,880
Ready to combine!

381
00:29:12,040 --> 00:29:13,980
Black Rino's standing by!

382
00:29:15,940 --> 00:29:17,580
Crack your head, activate!

383
00:29:18,440 --> 00:29:19,360
Let's do this!

384
00:29:21,600 --> 00:29:22,860
Sorry, bros!

385
00:29:23,040 --> 00:29:24,500
It's only got one seat!

386
00:29:25,900 --> 00:29:26,730
What?!

387
00:29:26,813 --> 00:29:27,643
This is a betrayal!

388
00:29:28,740 --> 00:29:29,960
Who's that up there?

389
00:29:30,180 --> 00:29:32,740
It's Usohachi and Chaparibon!

390
00:29:32,960 --> 00:29:34,254
Are you two all right?

391
00:29:34,480 --> 00:29:35,917
Back to the pleasure hall.

392
00:29:36,000 --> 00:29:38,137
You guys really stuck
your necks out for us.

393
00:29:38,220 --> 00:29:40,580
We really owe you one. Yeah, sure.

394
00:29:40,840 --> 00:29:43,640
But you can thank us later. Yeah, later!

395
00:29:43,980 --> 00:29:47,780
Right now, there's a robot
that you've gotta see! E-poo!

396
00:30:03,520 --> 00:30:08,040
Iron Pirate: General Franky.

397
00:30:13,680 --> 00:30:15,280
Let's rock!

398
00:30:16,380 --> 00:30:18,060
Franky Ken.

399
00:30:19,620 --> 00:30:22,000
Why do you have a giant robot?

400
00:30:22,460 --> 00:30:23,320
Come on

401
00:30:31,660 --> 00:30:35,920
He took out Chalky fast, but
there's bad news. Let's move.

402
00:30:36,080 --> 00:30:37,217
We'll just get stopped.

403
00:30:37,300 --> 00:30:38,130
Oh, yeah

404
00:30:46,240 --> 00:30:48,000
I hope he got away.

405
00:30:48,240 --> 00:30:50,593
I hate to say it, but this suit is tough

406
00:30:54,780 --> 00:30:55,737
Oh sorry.

407
00:30:55,820 --> 00:30:57,920
This just tickles my funny bone.

408
00:30:58,200 --> 00:30:59,540
Look around us.

409
00:30:59,780 --> 00:31:01,000
We're outnumbered.

410
00:31:01,240 --> 00:31:03,120
Enemies on every side.

411
00:31:03,520 --> 00:31:08,020
And yet, for some reason, I
feel like we can't be beat.

412
00:31:08,280 --> 00:31:09,500
You're damn right.

413
00:31:09,660 --> 00:31:11,057
I thought the same thing.

414
00:31:11,140 --> 00:31:12,020
I wonder why.

415
00:31:12,280 --> 00:31:14,280
Where does this courage come from?

416
00:31:14,400 --> 00:31:17,680
When you put it that way,
I suppose we have Mr.

417
00:31:17,840 --> 00:31:19,546
Straw Hat to thank, don't we?

418
00:31:22,560 --> 00:31:25,317
Looks like I won't be able
to jump up there after all.

419
00:31:25,400 --> 00:31:27,597
I guess I need a new plan.

420
00:31:27,680 --> 00:31:29,680
I've got your back, Captain.

421
00:31:30,620 --> 00:31:31,517
You've got me.

422
00:31:31,600 --> 00:31:32,620
Let's head up.

423
00:31:35,400 --> 00:31:36,960
This is a damn pain.

424
00:31:37,940 --> 00:31:38,857
Bastards were ready.

425
00:31:38,940 --> 00:31:40,597
They got the whole swarm up there.

426
00:31:40,680 --> 00:31:42,697
They'll be nothing but caterpillars.

427
00:31:42,780 --> 00:31:44,357
Once we tear off their wings.

428
00:31:44,440 --> 00:31:48,087
I get the sentiment, but do you
have to be so creepy about it?

429
00:31:49,560 --> 00:31:53,120
I suppose those dinosaurs are
the fabled lead performers.

430
00:31:57,160 --> 00:32:01,640
They look pretty tough, but I'm not
worried because our captain's stronger.

431
00:32:02,000 --> 00:32:02,830
That's right.

432
00:32:02,913 --> 00:32:07,520
And as Navigator, it's my duty to
help him get wherever he needs to go.

433
00:32:11,360 --> 00:32:13,066
Don't sweat a thing, brother!

434
00:32:13,400 --> 00:32:17,576
General Frankie's gonna clear out
those thugs before you can say super!

435
00:32:19,900 --> 00:32:21,429
Everyone's ready, Captain.

436
00:32:23,880 --> 00:32:24,710
Right!

437
00:32:24,920 --> 00:32:26,300
Time for round two!

438
00:32:26,600 --> 00:32:27,580
Let's do it!

439
00:32:28,220 --> 00:32:29,050
Samurai!

440
00:32:29,400 --> 00:32:30,860
Don't give them an inch!

441
00:32:31,120 --> 00:32:32,800
We're counting on you!

442
00:32:47,720 --> 00:32:50,220
You better get ready, Kaido!

443
00:32:51,100 --> 00:32:52,880
I'm coming for you!
